<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97863" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκομ-ῐδή</span></b> , ἡ, of
		harvest, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gathering in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν καρποῦ ξυγκομιδῇ ἦσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῶν ἐκ γῆς καρπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					149e
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὡραίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					845e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.5.14
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>ingathering, harvest, PCair. Zen.</i><i><span class="en">
				225.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1100.28
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				175.25
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, etc.: cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκομίζω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pass.
			sense, <i>being gathered together, crowding</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν ἀγρῶν ἐς τὸ ἄστυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.52
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἱστορίας</span>
			<i>compiling</i> of history, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.1.1
			</span></i>.</div>
